  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ECHO funding for Providing Humanitarian Assistance in Sahel Emergencies (PHASE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity ECHO funding for Providing Humanitarian Assistance in Sahel Emergencies (PHASE) is a component of Providing Humanitarian Assistance in Sahel Emergencies (PHASE) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xA3;103,500,000. This project benefits South of Sahara, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Material relief assistance and services.</narrative>
